","            p = preds.get(r.frame, np.zeros((0, 5))); p = p[p[:, 4] >= thr]\n","            hit = len(p) > 0 and box_iou_np(np.array([r.x, r.y, r.x + r.w, r.y + r.h]), p[:, :4]).max() >= 0.5\n","            err.append(dict(variant=variant, grade=r.grade, size=np.sqrt(r.w * r.h), hit=hit))\n","err = pd.DataFrame(err)\n","if len(err):\n","    err[\"size_bin\"] = pd.cut(err[\"size\"], [0, 30, 45, 70, 300])\n","    display(err.pivot_table(index=\"grade\", columns=\"variant\", values=\"hit\", aggfunc=\"mean\").reindex(GRADES).round(3))\n","    display(err.pivot_table(index=\"size_bin\", columns=\"variant\", values=\"hit\", aggfunc=\"mean\", observed=False).round(3))\n","    err.to_csv(OUT / \"tables/error_analysis_detection.csv\", index=False)"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"b5aee350","metadata":{"papermill":{"duration":0.030479,"end_time":"2026-11-18T13:53:16.415344+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-11-18T13:53:16.384865+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"source":["## 13. External validation (ARCADE stenosis set) — runs only if data is present\n","\n","ARCADE (Popov et al., *Sci Data* 2024) labels stenoses ≥50% only, which matches label definition **L2**. Models are trained on **all** CADICA patients using the median best epoch from cross-validation, then evaluated zero-shot. Expected layout: `ARCADE_ROOT/stenosis/test/images/*.png` and `ARCADE_ROOT/stenosis/test/annotations/*.json` (COCO). **Check your download** and adjust the two glob patterns if needed.\n","\n","AngioCAD (Zenodo 15826856, 413 patients, artery-level 7-category labels) is the planned second external set. Its label format must be verified after download before writing an evaluation, so it is not implemented here."]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":19,"id":"a181deb8","metadata":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2026-11-18T13:53:16.475914Z","iopub.status.busy":"2026-11-18T13:53:16.475639Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-11-18T13:53:16.487876Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-11-18T13: